{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"35c2e7cfafcb1fc822df20a6f67078ad8267d2904600b18a5fe7e611f9f41011","digest":{"component_or_area":"review observability sidecars and audit read layer","key_entities":["REVIEW_RESULT","plan_review_result_v2","code_review_result_v2","completion_verifier_pass_v1","block_threshold","blocking_enabled","CompletionVerdict.criteria","rebar.audit.read.audit_trail","rebar audit show","audit_trail MCP","relates_to","four-pass kernel (find/verify/decide/coach)"],"problem_keywords":["audit trail","lossless capture","review sidecar enrichment","completion-verification pass record","sidecar retention","schema versioning","backward compatibility","audit read layer"],"propositions":["Plan-review and code-review sidecars drop pass-1 evidence/scenarios and non-surfaced finding buckets and never persist the resolved numeric block_threshold, losing audit data.","Completion-verification emits a sidecar only on FAIL, so a PASS leaves no per-criterion audit record and persists only signed counts.","New v2 sidecar schemas capture the full four-pass record across all buckets including per-finding verification, decision, block_threshold, and pass-4 coaching.","A completion PASS must persist a per-criterion audit record rather than counts alone.","An audit read layer (library plus CLI and MCP) returns the full retained history for a ticket and its relates_to-linked code reviews.","Review-sidecar retention cap is raised and v1/v2 schemas remain mutually readable with no backfill or migration required."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785204406727039441,"uuid":"48bdeabd-779a-472a-a792-6fe1bee88c58"}